Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||12-27-2001||06:53 PM||||Here' mine. Her name is INDY. She's 5 years old. Is 19 lbs (working w/vet on the weight)<P>She likes sleeping upsidedown on her back, paws in the air. <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00306.jpg">  <P>She's so playful. The other day I crumpled up a sheet of paper, threw it toward the trash can, missed. Well, INDY jumped on it, and chased it around the room.<P>It was so funny. Here's a few more  Let's see yours !!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00246.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00250.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00252.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBluesig.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Sour Lemon||12-27-2001||07:25 PM||||My 2 cats.<BR>Georgina is a one year old kitty who enjoys playing with anything stringy.  She steals the laces from my shoes at least once a week.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/georginapillow.jpg"> <P>Kitty is a macho man cat.  He is well known in my house for terrorizing the bathroom as well at stealing my cell phone.  His other hobbies include sleeping on my laptop, and playing with the water cooler handles.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FIGHT.JPG"> <BR>||||reg||12
